window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Keeping her safe was my job. Keeping her for myself became my obsession.</b></p> <p>She is a Russian mafia princess, kidnapped to be used as a pawn in a deadly turf war. I was hired to bring her home, but the moment I saw her I knew I must have her for myself.</p> <p>She can run, but I will always be watching from the shadows. Like a feral beast stalking his prey, waiting for the right moment to take what is mine.</p> <p>I am her protector, but no one can protect her from me.</p> <p><i>Sweet Ferocity</i> is a standalone novel and the fifth and final entry in the Ruthless Obsession series. It includes spankings, rough sexual scenes, intense and humiliating punishments, and strong D/s themes.</p>"; 
